<title>POLAND: SOCCER-POLAND V GEORGIA WORLD CUP QUALIFIER TEAMS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-POLAND V GEORGIA WORLD CUP QUALIFIER TEAMS.</headline>
<dateline>KATOWICE, Poland 1997-06-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Teams for Poland and</p>
<p>Georgia in their World Cup European zone group two qualifier on</p>
<p>Saturday:</p>
<p>Poland: 1-Grzegorz Szamotulski, 2-Pawel Skrzypek, 3-Mariusz</p>
<p>Kukielka, 4-Radoslaw Michalski, 5-Radoslaw Kaluzny, 6-Tomasz</p>
<p>Sokolowski, 7-Krzysztof Bukalski, 8-Adam Ledwon, 9-Jacek</p>
<p>Dembinski, 10-Krzysztof Nowak, 11-Miroslaw Trzeciak.</p>
<p>Georgia: 1-Irakli Zoidje, 2-Nugzar Lobdjanidje, 3-Kakha</p>
<p>Cchadadje, 4-Lewan Kobiashvili, 5-Kacza Kaladje, 6-Kakha</p>
<p>Gogichaishvili, 7-Georgi Nemsadje, 8-Goha Djamarauli, 9-Temur</p>
<p>Kecbaja, 10-Georgi Kinkladje, 11-Shota Arveladje.</p>
</text>
